                    1731    ;
                    1732    ;===============
                    1733    ;
                    1734    ;TSTN   (LBL)
                    1735    ;       Test if indicated string is an unsigned number.
                    1736    ;       If so, move cursor over string and trailing blanks,
                    1737    ;       compute number's binary value,
                    1738    ;       push onto arithmetic expression stack, and continue with
                    1739    ;       following IL instruction.
