                    1773    ;       If so, print characters from the BASIC source program to the console
                    1774    ;       until a (closing) quote is encountered,
TB51            Tiny-Basic51 - Modified for Metalink ASM51                                                    PAGE 29

                    1775    ;       pass over any trailing blanks,
                    1776    ;       leave source cursor pointing to first non-blank character,
                    1777    ;       and branch to IL instruction at location (LBL).
                    1778    ;       (Report syntax error if <CR> encountered before quote.)
