                    2351    ;               2 byte LABEL of line initiating FOR loop,
                    2352    ;               2 byte LIMIT specified by FOR statement,
                    2353    ;               2 byte INDEX of variable used by FOR loop,
                    2354    ;               1 byte TYPE of variable code.
                    2355    ;       If indices disagree, then generate syntax error.
                    2356    ;       Otherwise, store incremented value in variable popping both from AES.
                    2357    ;       If the incremented value <= LIMIT then return with carry set.
                    2358    ;       If incr. val. > LIMIT looping is done, so return with carry not set.
                    2359    ;
